Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Mathematica code for implementation of the reduced model for facultative \
syntrophy\
\>", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980838801682358*^9, 3.980838821219701*^9}, {
  3.9808392557478*^9, 3.980839259530222*^9}, {3.98894452928913*^9, 
  3.988944536398575*^9}, {4.000550050057602*^9, 4.000550069183681*^9}, {
  4.000550665677516*^9, 
  4.00055067444103*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6f41e2ca-f7f6-451c-8935-\
c525c3e9cf48"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This notebook contains source code for the following preprint article:\n",
 StyleBox["\nDroste MJ, Planqu\[EAcute] R, Bruggeman FJ (2026) Emergent \
metabolic cooperation in communities of microbes that maximise growth rate by \
optimal protein expression. \n",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9296947437186413`*^9, 3.9296951020392857`*^9}, {
   3.9301480170576887`*^9, 3.930148041336217*^9}, {3.930217504016037*^9, 
   3.930217657615096*^9}, {3.930217693247149*^9, 3.930217726206396*^9}, {
   3.9433578287223663`*^9, 3.9433578377303247`*^9}, {3.9488647433446007`*^9, 
   3.948864937179102*^9}, {3.948865021276495*^9, 3.948865021678293*^9}, 
   3.948865127850287*^9, {3.966665356685046*^9, 3.9666653768499613`*^9}, 
   3.966665977467705*^9, {3.992920968059231*^9, 3.992920976301819*^9}, {
   4.00055009951343*^9, 4.000550117571023*^9}, {4.002099034107502*^9, 
   4.002099040787142*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"738a31e0-f90e-42eb-b54b-\
05b4df46b0df"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Short description",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nThis code contains the implementation of the reduced model for \
facultative syntrophy, where we assume the consuming species to be a passive \
consumer of the exchange metabolite ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["P", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d7aa6fd6-3385-4acc-9106-26bc909d6e88"],
 ". This assumption allows for direct perturbation of the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["P", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c9ea8b68-60e5-4189-9b8c-bb2608f57d8f"],
 " concentration, and reduces the coupled optimisation problem for the \
community growth rate of a two-species community to a single-species \
optimisation problem. For this reduced model we show that a switch from \
metabolic mode 2 to mode 1 occurs as the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["P", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "63bf99bb-62a3-486f-9c86-a2fa83a85b78"],
 " concentration decreases.\nMore information on the implementation of the \
reduced model and facultative syntrophy can be found in the Supplementary \
Appendices of the article."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9296947437186413`*^9, 3.9296951020392857`*^9}, {
  3.9301480170576887`*^9, 3.930148041336217*^9}, {3.930191498870511*^9, 
  3.930191582164893*^9}, {3.9301951765022163`*^9, 3.930195176982151*^9}, {
